<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Electrical Mart India</title>
<style>
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial;background:#f2f5fa;color:#17233b}
header{background:#092653;color:white;padding:22px;text-align:center}
header h1{margin:0;color:#ffb52e}
nav{background:#123b70;padding:13px;text-align:center}
nav a{color:white;text-decoration:none;margin:10px}
.hero{padding:40px 15px;text-align:center;background:#dceaff}
.hero h2{font-size:28px}
.search{padding:12px;width:80%;max-width:400px;border:1px solid #aaa;border-radius:6px}
button{background:#ff9f00;color:#fff;border:0;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:5px}
.products{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(145px,1fr));gap:15px;padding:18px}
.card{background:white;padding:18px;text-align:center;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px #ddd}
.icon{font-size:38px}
.card h3{font-size:17px}
footer{background:#092653;color:white;text-align:center;padding:20px}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
<h1>⚡ ELECTRICAL MART INDIA</h1>
<p>One Nation – One Electrical Marketplace</p>
</header>

<nav>
<a href="#">Home</a>
<a href="#products">Products</a>
<a href="#about">About</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
<h2>भारत का अपना Electrical Marketplace</h2>
<p>Every Electrical Brand. Every Electrical Product. One Marketplace.</p>
<input class="search" type="search" placeholder="Search Electrical Products">
<br><br>
<button onclick="alert('Shopping feature coming soon!')">Explore Products</button>
</section>

<h2 style="text-align:center">Our Products</h2>

<section class="products" id="products">
<div class="card"><div class="icon">⚡</div><h3>MCB & MCCB</h3></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">🔌</div><h3>Switch & Socket</h3></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">💡</div><h3>LED Lighting</h3></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">⚙️</div><h3>Electric Motors</h3></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">🔋</div><h3>Battery & Solar</h3></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">🔧</div><h3>Electrical Tools</h3></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">🔗</div><h3>Cables & Wires</h3></div>
<div class="card"><div class="icon">🛠️</div><h3>Electrical Panels</h3></div>
</section>

<section id="about" style="padding:20px;text-align:center">
<h2>About Electrical Mart India</h2>
<p>एक ही प्लेटफॉर्म पर सभी Electrical Brands और Products.</p>
</section>

<footer id="contact">
<h3>Electrical Mart India</h3>
<p>Coming Soon – All India Electrical Marketplace</p>
<p>© 2026 Electrical Mart India</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
